<%# locals: (soul:, name:, portrait: nil, role: nil, store: "studioTalkToAgent") %>
<%#
  The talk-to-agent modal (docs/AGENT_CHAT.md, "Talk to an agent in a modal"):
  the shared agent chat (studio/agent_chat/_chat) in a card on the page-scoped
  modal host (studio/modals/_scoped_host). Render it ONCE per page, then mark any
  link with studio_talk_to_agent_link (Studio::AgentChatHelper), or by hand with
  data-studio-talk-to-agent, data-talk-soul, data-talk-topic and an optional
  data-talk-opener.

  soul      the agent's slug; must be on Studio.agent_chat_souls.
  name      the agent's display name.
  portrait  ready markup for a small round portrait (40px works); nil shows the initial.
  role      ready markup or text beside the name.
  store     the Alpine store the host registers; unique on the page, never "modals".

  A click opens the card and studio/talk_to_agent clones the chat out of the
  <template> below into it, with the link's opener: the chat loads the thread
  and sends the opener, so the agent is already answering as the card animates
  in, and each new answer types itself in. The chat is the same one as anywhere
  else (one thread per person and soul, held by the hub): this partial adds a
  card and an opener, never a second chat. One page holds one chat, so the page
  that renders this modal renders no other studio/agent_chat/chat.

  A viewer Studio.agent_chat_allowed refuses gets nothing here, and every link
  then opens its href. The x-data on the wrapper is load-bearing: the scoped host
  declares no Alpine scope of its own.
%>
<% souls = Studio.agent_chat_soul_list %>
<% raise ArgumentError, "studio/agent_chat/talk_modal: soul #{soul.inspect} is not in Studio.agent_chat_souls (#{souls.inspect})" unless souls.include?(soul.to_s) %>
<% if Studio.agent_chat_allowed?(studio_agent_chat_viewer) %>
<div x-data data-studio-controller="talk-to-agent" data-test="talk-to-agent"
     data-talk-to-agent-soul="<%= soul %>" data-talk-to-agent-name="<%= name %>" data-talk-to-agent-store="<%= store %>">
  <%= render "studio/modals/scoped_host", store: store,
             card_class: "bg-surface rounded-2xl border border-subtle shadow-2xl w-full max-w-lg p-4 sm:p-5" do %>
    <template x-if="$store.<%= store %>.current()?.id === 'talk-to-agent'">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 min-w-0" data-talk-to-agent-panel data-test="talk-to-agent-panel"
           x-init="$nextTick(() => $dispatch('studio:talk-to-agent:panel'))">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 min-w-0">
          <span class="w-10 h-10 shrink-0 rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-inset border border-subtle flex items-center justify-center text-heading font-bold [&>img]:w-full [&>img]:h-full [&>img]:object-cover" aria-hidden="true">
            <% if portrait.present? %><%= portrait %><% else %><%= name.to_s.first.to_s.upcase %><% end %>
          </span>
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <p class="font-semibold text-heading break-words" data-talk-to-agent-title data-test="talk-to-agent-title">Talk to <%= name %></p>
            <% if role.present? %><p class="text-xs text-secondary break-words"><%= role %></p><% end %>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm shrink-0" aria-label="Close"
                  @click="$store.<%= store %>.close()" data-test="talk-to-agent-close">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5l10 10M15 5L5 15"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="min-w-0" data-talk-to-agent-slot data-test="talk-to-agent-slot"></div>
      </div>
    </template>
  <% end %>
  <template data-talk-to-agent-chat><%= render "studio/agent_chat/chat", soul: soul, name: name, portrait: portrait, compact: true,
                                                empty: "#{name} will answer here in a moment." %></template>
</div>
<% end %>
